			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750360201,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，怎么了，刚刚看你刨啊刨的，挖出了什么了不起的东西吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360202,
					"content": "啊，难道挖到了什么值钱的宝藏？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360203,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360204,
					"content": "嗯…我来看看，这个看上去好像是什么东西的种子…没想到在这个看上去像是荒地的地方，还能挖出这样的东西呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360205,
					"content": "唔嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360206,
					"content": "不过，这个看上去应该不是特别值钱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360207,
					"content": "唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360208,
						750360209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360208,
					"content": "种子蕴含的是无限的可能…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750360210,
					"content": "不过，怎么看都是已经荒废了的地方…土看上去都硬硬的，这个种子真的还活着吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360211,
					"content": "唔…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360212,
					"content": "你是在难过吗…不过这个很难说啦，毕竟有些种子天生就没有办法发芽…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360213,
					"content": "不过具体如何，我们就再种下去看看吧，也许它到现在还没发芽，只是因为挖的坑不好，也没有足够的营养。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360214,
					"content": "我们再好好种下去，说不定它就能长出来呢！嘿嘿，会长出什么呢，超大的颗粒果，嗯…特别特别香的苦种也不错！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360215,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360216,
					"content": "也许会长出骗骗花…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750360217,
					"content": "这种时候就不要扫兴啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360218,
					"content": "不过纳塔的植物会需要什么营养呢…不管了，先种下去再说吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750360209,
					"content": "说不定能长出了不起的玩意儿！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750360210
					]
				}
			]
		},
